        "section": "2",
        "section_title": "Applications",
        "text": "The applicant must show the need for restoration at the time of application for the program on the Conservation Plan Schedule of Operations (AD-1155) for easements and for rental contracts, and agree to maintain all funded conservation practices and activities.",
